 LOADS / BATTERY AND POWER" (at 101.6 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 9f6748cc-0648-5a93-bf49-a110105e7c8b)) (text "2S protected pack, independent supervisor rails, host converters and floating AFE supplies. Digital circuit design, not implant qualification." (at 101.6 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 71df8c14-b10d-55d1-a339-c3a4bf282769)) (text "All labels are native electrical connections. PG is diagnostic; full qualification remains the nine independent supervision windows." (at 101.6 416.56 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 40806921-2d44-5533-a4c5-36c491f08170)) (text "Converter shutdown does not discharge boost paths or remove stored energy. Body-facing shutdown remains the separate terminal guards." (at 101.6 424.18 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid af563200-c7c0-584b-ade7-1858336caddd)))
